# Playtest report — build `playtest-1`

**Build played:** release `playtest-1` in world/producer, `snake-playtest-1.zip` (game-developer a559f2e + artist assets 5340842), unzipped and served with `python3 -m http.server 8000`; also opened once via `file://`.
**How played:** headless Chromium (Playwright 1.64), 1280x800 (plus 1366x768, 1024x600, 800x500, 1920x1080), real keyboard events at real time (Enter, Space, arrows, P, Esc), a mouse click on "Play again". Game state was *read* via `window.SnakeGame` to check numbers; nothing was set through it except where noted. Scripts: `scripts/`; logs: `evidence/run1-3.log`; recordings: `evidence/run1-scripted.webm`, `evidence/run2-bot.webm`.

## Verdict
**Playable and completable start to finish; every R1–R11 observed working.** One real defect for this build: **a flood of 404 console errors** (asset paths do not match, see below) — the brief's build standard says "no console errors". Everything else is minor.

